SJc6MJPwj","diff_hunk":"@@ -338,6 +338,23 @@ class AHashMap {\n \t\treturn nullptr;\n \t}\n \n+\tTValue &get_value_ref_or_add_default(const TKey &p_key, bool &r_was_added) {","path":"core/templates/a_hash_map.h","commit_id":"834f8fb71ea641997213202c3b3647e0dda137c6","original_commit_id":"677d862ce082019c762fe84ebe76ec56b7725d32","user":{"login":"Nazarwadim","id":116561933,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvKYDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116561933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim","html_url":"https://github.com/Nazarwadim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"You can use `find + insert_new` instead\r\n\r\nFor example \r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/677d862ce082019c762fe84ebe76ec56b7725d32/scene/animation/animation_tree.cpp#L136\r\n\r\nHere you can:\r\n```c++\r\n\tAHashMap<StringName, Pair<Variant, bool>> &property_map = process_state->tree->property_map;\r\n\tauto iter = property_cache.find(p_name);\r\n\tif(!iter) {\r\n\t\titer = property_cache.insert_new(p_name, 0);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\treturn property_map.get_by_index(iter->value).value.first;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-09-16T07:32:43Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T07:32:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474#discussion_r2351234083","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110474","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2351234083"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474#discussion_r2351234083"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110474"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2351234083/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":334,"original_line":341,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2346066990,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2353155366","pull_request_review_id":3230964312,"id":2353155366,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6MQk0m","diff_hunk":"@@ -338,6 +338,23 @@ class AHashMap {\n \t\treturn nullptr;\n \t}\n \n+\tTValue &get_value_ref_or_add_default(const TKey &p_key, bool &r_was_added) {","path":"core/templates/a_hash_map.h","commit_id":"834f8fb71ea641997213202c3b3647e0dda137c6","original_commit_id":"677d862ce082019c762fe84ebe76ec56b7725d32","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> You can use `find + insert_new` instead\r\n> \r\n> For example\r\n> \r\n> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/677d862ce082019c762fe84ebe76ec56b7725d32/scene/animation/animation_tree.cpp#L136\r\n> \r\n> Here you can:\r\n> \r\n> ```c++\r\n> \tAHashMap<StringName, Pair<Variant, bool>> &property_map = process_state->tree->property_map;\r\n> \tauto iter = property_cache.find(p_name);\r\n> \tif(!iter) {\r\n> \t\titer = property_cache.insert_new(p_name, 0);\r\n> \t} else {\r\n> \t\treturn property_map.get_by_index(iter->value).value.first;\r\n> \t}\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nProblem is using `find` then `insert_new` hashes the key twice, while `get_value_ref_or_add_default` hashes it once.","created_at":"2025-09-16T17:14:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T17:14:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474#discussion_r2353155366","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110474","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2353155366"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474#discussion_r2353155366"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110474"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2353155366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":334,"original_line":341,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2346066990,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]